<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Murf AI is a professional-grade text-to-speech platform designed for businesses and content creators who demand studio-quality voiceovers. With over 120 carefully curated AI voices across multiple languages and accents, Murf focuses on delivering polished, professional audio suitable for presentations, videos, e-learning, and marketing materials.</p>
<p>What distinguishes Murf from competitors is its emphasis on professional use cases. The platform includes a built-in video editor, collaboration features, and enterprise-grade security, making it ideal for teams and businesses. The voices are meticulously crafted to sound natural and professional, avoiding the uncanny valley that plagues many TTS solutions.</p>
<h2 id="features">Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="19" y2="23"></line><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="23" y2="23"></line></svg></div>
<h4>120+ Studio Voices</h4>
<p>Professionally trained AI voices across different ages, accents, and speaking styles. All voices sound natural and polished.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
